{"timestamp": "2026-08-23T06:40:03.145+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_dadae821-e5b2-4f73-a972-bac22054c3b4", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): my credit card is ugly, i want to replace it\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back. Previously I explained the FAQ steps for replacing a physically damaged credit card. How can I assist you further or with something new?\nUser: How do I replace a physically damaged credit card?\nAI: Open the Horizon app and sign in\nTap ‘Card Management’\nSelect ‘Replace Current Card’\nChoose ‘Damaged’ as the reason and submit the request\nUser: my credit card is ugly, i want to replace it\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Access card management in the mobile app to initiate a replacement request for damaged cards only\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued exclusively for physical damage or technical failure of the existing card chip\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement services are provided to ensure continued functionality of the credit card for daily transactions\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Credit_Card\", \"Rewards_Program\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"The user is requesting a credit card replacement because they find their current card aesthetically unappealing.\", \"direct_query\": \"The user is requesting a credit card replacement because they find their current card aesthetically unappealing.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Access card management in the mobile app to initiate a replacement request for damaged cards only\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued exclusively for physical damage or technical failure of the existing card chip\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement services are provided to ensure continued functionality of the credit card for daily transactions\"}, {\"group_id\": \"retry_4\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to the card services menu to confirm if your specific card type qualifies for a replacement\", \"policy\": \"The bank does not apply any service fees or processing charges when issuing a replacement credit card\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement requests are processed without additional costs to ensure customers maintain access to their credit facilities\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent faq_33f045af provides relevant instructions for card replacement through the Horizon App, but it specifies replacement is for damaged cards, which addresses the procedure while leaving the aesthetic motivation unaddressed.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"fact\": \"Replacement cards can be ordered by logging into the Horizon App, opening the card dashboard, and selecting Freeze Card followed by Order Replacement.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent faq_33f045af provides the procedure to replace a card through the Horizon App, which addresses the replacement action, though aesthetic unappealfulness is not covered by the damage policy.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 3, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent faq_33f045af provides the procedure to replace a card through the Horizon App, addressing the replacement action while aesthetic unappealfulness is not covered by the damage policy.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8336a2c7\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank does not impose any charges for card replacements.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_25ce7c68\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for requesting a waiver of charges on my Horizon Bank credit card account?\\n\\nAnswer: To request a waiver of a late payment fee, simply send a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service, specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. Our team will carefully review your request and provide an update via push notification within {{faq_25ce7c68_001}} working days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7672e1dd\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for paying my Horizon credit card bill?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Using a Horizon savings account**\\n  - Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  - Navigate to **Money** → **Credit Card** → **Pay credit card**.\\n  - Your Horizon Savings account will appear; pick it from the list.\\n  - Verify the payment details and swipe up to authorise.\\n  - For guidance on funding your Horizon Savings account, visit: https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/savings-account/#how-do-i-deposit-money-into-my-savings-account\\n\\n- **Using accounts at other banks**\\n  You may settle your Horizon credit card bill from another bank either by adding the card number as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient. Below are the typical flows for major Singapore banks.\\n\\n  **DBS/POSB**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_001}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open **Pay & Transfer** > **Local** > **Add Local Recipient** > **Bank Account**.\\n  - Input the recipient name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your {{faq_7672e1dd_002}}‑digit Horizon card number as the account number.\\n  - Confirm the details and add the recipient (additional verification may be required).\\n  - Return to **Pay & Transfer** > **Local**, choose your Horizon card, enter the amount, ensure **FAST** is enabled, and proceed.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_003}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_004}} working days)*\\n  - Go to **Pay & Transfer** > **Cards** > **Add Credit Card Recipient**.\\n  - Provide your {{faq_7672e1dd_005}}‑digit Horizon card number, select card type **Singapore – VISA/MasterCard**, and fill in your name.\\n  - After adding, select the card under **Cards**, input the payment amount, and confirm.\\n\\n  **UOB**\\n  - Choose **Pay & Transfer** > **Other Accounts / Cards** > **New Transfer**.\\n  - Under **Bank Account / Other Institutions**, pick “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and enter your {{faq_7672e1dd_006}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Specify the amount and swipe to submit.\\n\\n  **OCBC**\\n  - Tap **Local Transfers** > **Account Number** > **Add payee**.\\n  - Enter the payee name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your Horizon card number (use your initials for the reference).\\n  - After adding, wait roughly {{faq_7672e1dd_007}} hours for the payee to become active, then initiate a local transfer to the card and confirm.\\n\\n  **Standard Chartered Bank Singapore**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_008}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open the menu > **Transfer & Payments** > **Local Transfer**.\\n  - Add a new payee, choose **Local**, enter “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and your {{faq_7672e1dd_009}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Authenticate with your {{faq_7672e1dd_010}}‑digit PIN and confirm.\\n  - Select the newly added Horizon card as the destination, enter the amount, and swipe to complete.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_011}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_012}} working days)*\\n  - Menu > **Transfers & Payments** > **Add & Manage Biller** > **Other Bank’s Credit Card Payee**.\\n  - Provide the cardholder name and your Horizon card number, then continue.\\n  - After confirming the payee, enter your PIN, choose **Move My Money**, pick **Pay Other Bank Credit Cards**, select the Horizon card as the payee, specify the source account and amount, and finalize.\\n\\n  For any bank not listed, you can still add your Horizon card number either as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient; processing typically takes about {{faq_7672e1dd_013}} working days.\\n\\n  **Important note**: If you hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card, ensure the card is paired with the savings account before using the paired‑payment method. Details on pairing are available at https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/credit-card/#how-does-the-card-pairing-work.\\n\\n  Failure to pay by the due date may result in a late‑payment fee and interest on the outstanding balance. Making only the minimum payment also incurs interest on the remaining amount. For full terms, consult the Horizon FAQs or the customer T&Cs on the website or app.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ff1c2b9c\", \"content\": \"Question: The Horizon App indicates that my physical card has been delivered, but I have not received it yet.\\n\\nAnswer: - Contact us through the Horizon App by initiating a live chat or a voice call.\\n- Alternatively, you can reach our support line at +{{faq_ff1c2b9c_001}} {{faq_ff1c2b9c_002}}-HORIZ ( +{{faq_ff1c2b9c_003}} {{faq_ff1