ditions, you can submit an application. The typical timeframe for approval is very fast – most loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds. 🚀\\n\\nFeel free to let me know if you’d like more details on any of the requirements!\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
