 meet to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile device and MyInfo authentication are sufficient to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after completing registration, you will still need to use SingPass to verify your identity when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_10f9fec0\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the requirements to open a new Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate the application process for a Horizon Bank account, simply utilize your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo, which will expedite the pre-filling of your application in a secure manner. For non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation, particularly if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Tas