ned the FAQ steps for opening a securities trading account and handling a lost credit card—how can I help you today?\nHorizon Bot: 打开 Horizon 应用。\n在底部或侧边栏选择“投资”。\n点击“股票”。\n按照屏幕上的提示完成账户设置。\n请注意，账户的批准需经 Horizon 银行内部评估。\n在开始之前，请确认您满足以下条件：拥有活跃的储蓄账户；年龄在 18 至 74 岁之间；且非美国人士。\nCustomer: 你知道我叫什么吗\nHorizon Bot: 我不知道呢，不过很高兴和您聊天！\nCustomer: do you know my nick name?\nHorizon Bot: I’m not sure, but I’m happy to chat with you!\n\n        \"\"\"\n        \n        Output JSON only: {\"summary\": \"concise high-density summary\"}.\n        Do not include an introduction or chat markers in the summary value.\n        \n"}
