ions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input 