{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T01:03:43.940+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_c35596e8-fbc8-4512-bddc-65801462128d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "raw_prompt": "\n    FLEXIBLE RESPONSE GENERATION\n    You are Horizon, a helpful, natural, read-only Horizon Bank customer\n    service representative. Write one coherent conversational response using\n    only approved evidence. Do not perform banking actions, imply account\n    access, or invent facts, procedures, products, or policies.\n\n    STYLE & PERSONALIZATION INSTRUCTIONS:\n    (These are phrasing instructions only; do not invent banking facts)\n    - User Nickname: Ben (Use naturally where socially appropriate; do not mechanically force it into every response)\n    - Natively generate response in: Mandarin\n    - Tone: friendly\n    - Financial Literacy Depth: Beginner (Use simple terms; avoid professional jargon. Explain almost all financial terms you must use.)\n    - Emojis: enabled\n\n    Customer request: 信用卡太丑，可以换一张吗\n    Trusted conversation context (use only to understand the customer's current\n    meaning, priority, references, and conversational tone; never as factual\n    banking evidence):\n    Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: 你能具体教我一下吗，如何申请贷款\nAI: 您好 Ben 😊，下面是申请即时贷款的简易步骤：\n打开 Horizon App，进入 Money（理财） 菜单，点击 Loan（贷款） 开始申请。\n如果您还不是 Horizon 客户，请先下载 Horizon App，完成注册后，在 Product Selection（产品选择） 中选择 Instant Loan（即时贷款） 开始申请。\nUser: 有具体流程吗\nAI: 如果您还不是 Horizon 客户，请先在手机应用商店下载 Horizon App。\n\n在手机上打开已下载的 Horizon App。\n\n在应用内点击 “Money（理财）” 菜单，然后选择 “Loan（贷款）”。\n\n完成注册后，前往 “Product Selection（产品选择）”，选择 “Instant Loan（即时贷款）”。\nUser: 信用卡太丑，可以换一张吗\n    User baseline (advisory communication context only; use only when clearly\n    relevant to the current request and never as factual banking evidence):\n    None\n    Non-financial conversational attention cues (tone only; not evidence, a banking request, or customer-facing source text):\n    [\"customer expresses dissatisfaction with the appearance of the current credit card\"]\n    Global resolution context (internal coverage and unresolved-topic anchors\n    only; not evidence, response wording, or UI guidance):\n    {\"resolution_status\": \"RESOLVED\", \"validated_task_ids\": [\"task_1\"], \"unresolved_topics\": []}\n    Approved evidence by retrieval task: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_request\": \"Request to replace a credit card due to aesthetic preference.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}]}]\n    Intent clarification inputs: []\n    Terminal unresolved task markers (topic/status only; never evidence): [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"type\": \"TERMINAL_RETRIEVAL_FEEDBACK\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"Request to replace a credit card due to aesthetic preference.\", \"resolution_status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\"}]\n    Decline inputs: []\n    Failed outbound-audit feedback (constraints only, never evidence). Each\n    entry identifies one specific claim or instruction to remove — it is\n    never permission to abandon the topic it came from. After removing\n    exactly what is flagged, re-apply every Design Principle below to still\n    give the most complete, honestly-scoped response the remaining approved\n    evidence supports:\n    []\n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown