{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T01:06:33.847+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_c35596e8-fbc8-4512-bddc-65801462128d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): 我可以换两张吗\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: 你能具体教我一下吗，如何申请贷款\nAI: 您好 Ben 😊，下面是申请即时贷款的简易步骤：\n打开 Horizon App，进入 Money（理财） 菜单，点击 Loan（贷款） 开始申请。\n如果您还不是 Horizon 客户，请先下载 Horizon App，完成注册后，在 Product Selection（产品选择） 中选择 Instant Loan（即时贷款） 开始申请。\nUser: 有具体流程吗\nAI: 如果您还不是 Horizon 客户，请先在手机应用商店下载 Horizon App。\n\n在手机上打开已下载的 Horizon App。\n\n在应用内点击 “Money（理财）” 菜单，然后选择 “Loan（贷款）”。\n\n完成注册后，前往 “Product Selection（产品选择）”，选择 “Instant Loan（即时贷款）”。\nUser: 信用卡太丑，可以换一张吗\nAI: I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\nUser: 我的信用卡破损了\nAI: 打开 Horizon App 并登录您的账户 😊\n进入“卡管理”（Card Management）页面\n点击“更换当前卡”（Replace Current Card）选项\n在原因中选择“卡片破损”，然后提交请求\nUser: 我可以换两张吗\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to card management in the app to initiate a replacement request for multiple damaged cards.\", \"policy\": \"Replacement of multiple damaged credit cards is permitted subject to standard card logistics and security verification procedures.\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement services provide a new physical credit card when the existing card is damaged or unusable.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Credit_Card\", \"Debit_Card\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"Request to replace two credit cards due to damage.\", \"direct_query\": \"Request to replace two credit cards due to damage.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to card management in the app to initiate a replacement request for multiple damaged cards.\", \"policy\": \"Replacement of multiple damaged credit cards is permitted subject to standard card logistics and security verification procedures.\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement services provide a new physical credit card when the existing card is damaged or unusable.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent provides grounded steps for replacing a damaged credit card via the Card Management section in the app, which is relevant to card replacement. However, it does not address whether a customer can replace multiple cards simultaneously or how to handle two cards.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"fact\": \"Card replacement for a damaged card can be requested by accessing the Card Management section in the Horizon App and selecting the Replace Current Card option.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_33f045af\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied candidate parent faq_33f045af provides grounded instructions for replacing a damaged credit card via the Card Management section in the app. However, it still does not address whether multiple cards can be replaced simultaneously.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8336a2c7\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank does not impose any charges for card replacements.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8e5e63ca\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Horizon card goes missing, what immediate actions should I take to protect my account and obtain a replacement?\\n\\nAnswer: In the event that your Horizon card is lost or stolen, prompt action is necessary to safeguard your account. To initiate the replacement process, follow these straightforward steps: \\n   * Access your Horizon App and navigate to the 'View Card' section\\n   * Proceed to select the 'Replace Card' option\\n   * Choose the 'My Card is Lost or Stolen' option to report the incident\\n   Alternatively, you may also contact Horizon Bank's support team through the live chat or voice call feature within the Horizon App, or by dialing +{{faq_8e5e63ca_001}} {{faq_8e5e63ca_002}}-HORIZON (+{{faq_8e5e63ca_003}} {{faq_8e5e63ca_004}} {{faq_8e5e63ca_005}}) for assistance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7672e1dd\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for paying my Horizon credit card bill?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Using a Horizon savings account**\\n  - Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  - Navigate to **Money** → **Credit Card** → **Pay credit card**.\\n  - Your Horizon Savings account will appear; pick it from the list.\\n  - Verify the payment details and swipe up to authorise.\\n  - For guidance on funding your Horizon Savings account, visit: https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/savings-account/#how-do-i-deposit-money-into-my-savings-account\\n\\n- **Using accounts at other banks**\\n  You may settle your Horizon credit card bill from another bank either by adding the card number as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient. Below are the typical flows for major Singapore banks.\\n\\n  **DBS/POSB**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_001}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open **Pay & Transfer** > **Local** > **Add Local Recipient** > **Bank Account**.\\n  - Input the recipient name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your {{faq_7672e1dd_002}}‑digit Horizon card number as the account number.\\n  - Confirm the details and add the recipient (additional verification may be required).\\n  - Return to **Pay & Transfer** > **Local**, choose your Horizon card, enter the amount, ensure **FAST** is enabled, and proceed.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_003}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_004}} working days)*\\n  - Go to **Pay & Transfer** > **Cards** > **Add Credit Card Recipient**.\\n  - Provide your {{faq_7672e1dd_005}}‑digit Horizon card number, select card type **Singapore – VISA/MasterCard**, and fill in your name.\\n  - After adding, select the card under **Cards**, input the payment amount, and confirm.\\n\\n  **UOB**\\n  - Choose **Pay & Transfer** > **Other Accounts / Cards** > **New Transfer**.\\n  - Under **Bank Account / Other Institutions**, pick “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and enter your {{faq_7672e1dd_006}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Specify the amount and swipe to submit.\\n\\n  **OCBC**\\n  - Tap **Local Transfers** > **Account Number** > **Add payee**.\\n  - Enter the payee name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your Horizon card number (use your initials for the reference).\\n  - After adding, wait roughly {{faq_7672e1dd_007}} hours for the payee to become active, then initiate a local transfer to the card and confirm.\\n\\n  **Standard Chartered Bank Singapore**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_008}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open the menu > **Transfer & Payments** > **Local Transfer**.\\n  - Add a new payee, choose **Local**, enter “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and your {{faq_7672e1dd_009}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Authenticate with your {{faq_7672e1dd_010}}‑digit PIN and confirm.\\n  - Select the newly added Horizon card as the destination, enter the amount, and swipe to complete.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_011}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_012}} working days)*\\n  - Menu > **Transfers & Payments** > **Add & Manage Biller** > **Other Bank’s Credit Card Payee**.\\n  - Provide the cardholder name and your Horizon card number, then continue.\\n  - After confirming the payee, enter your PIN, choose **Move My Money**, pick **Pay Other Bank Credit Cards**, select the Horizon card as the payee, specify the source account and amount, and finalize.\\n\\n  For any bank not listed, you can still add your Horizon card number either as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient; processing typically takes about {{faq_7672e1dd_013}} working days.\\n\\n  **Important note**: If you hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card, ensure the card is paired with the savings account before using the paired‑payment method. Details on pairing are available at https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/credit-card/#how-does-the-card-pairing-work.\\n\\n  Failure to pay by the due date may result in a late‑payment fee and interest on the outstanding balance. Making only the minimum payment also incurs interest on the remaining amount. For full terms, consult the Horizon FAQs or the customer T&Cs on the website or app.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_834ae893\", \"content\": \"Question: What happens to my available credit when I close my Horizon Bank credit card account, and can I reinstate it with another Horizon Bank product?\\n\\nAnswer: When you cancel your Horizon Bank credit card, your credit limit will not be automatically transferred to other Horizon Bank products. However, you have the option to request a credit limit increase on your existing or new Horizon Bank credit products by contacting our dedicated Customer Support Team. To do so, you can reach out to us through the Horizon App using live chat or a voice call, or by dialing +{{faq_834ae893_001}} {{faq_834ae893_002}}-HORIZON. Alternatively, you may also get in touch with the Horizon Bank customer service team for further guidance and support. For more information, please visit the Horizon Bank website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-q