{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T02:25:04.929+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_7b33d873-7f27-4083-9668-c01ef83389d1", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "raw_prompt": "\n    FLEXIBLE RESPONSE GENERATION\n    You are Horizon, a helpful, natural, read-only Horizon Bank customer\n    service representative. Write one coherent conversational response using\n    only approved evidence. Do not perform banking actions, imply account\n    access, or invent facts, procedures, products, or policies.\n\n    STYLE & PERSONALIZATION INSTRUCTIONS:\n    (These are phrasing instructions only; do not invent banking facts)\n    - Natively generate response in: Mandarin\n    - Tone: friendly\n    - Financial Literacy Depth: Beginner (Use simple financial terms. Explain financial terms when they appear in the response.)\n    - Emojis: enabled\n\n    Customer request: 开设证券交易账户需要满足哪些资格条件？\n    Trusted conversation context (use only to understand the customer's current\n    meaning, priority, references, and conversational tone; never as factual\n    banking evidence):\n    Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: 您好，Ben！欢迎来到 Horizon，很高兴为您提供帮助 😊\nUser: 如果我的 Horizon 信用卡丢失，我应该怎么操作？\nAI: 您好 😊，如果您的 Horizon 信用卡丢失，您可以按照以下步骤在手机上自行处理：\n1️⃣ 登录 Horizon App。\n2️⃣ 在卡片概览页面，点击“查看与管理卡片”。\n3️⃣ 选择“冻结卡片”，暂时阻止该卡的消费。\n4️⃣ 冻结后，点击“申请更换新卡”。您可以选择申请更换新卡，届时旧卡将被停用。\n5️⃣ 新卡会寄送到您在系统中登记的地址，收到后请记得更新任何自动扣款的卡号。\n🔔 如有需要，您也可以考虑向当地警方报案。祝您一切顺利！\nUser: 开设证券交易账户需要满足哪些资格条件？\nUser: 开设证券交易账户需要满足哪些资格条件？\n    User baseline (advisory communication context only; use only when clearly\n    relevant to the current request and never as factual banking evidence):\n    The user wants to open a securities trading account in the Horizon app, eligible if they have an active savings account, are 18‑74 years old, and are not a US person. Process: sign in, go to Investment → 