tity verification. Bring the original identification documents:\\n  • NRIC for Singapore citizens or permanent residents.\\n  • Passport for Work Pass or Dependent Pass holders.\\n- A Horizon representative will confirm your identity and continue processing your request.\\n- You can monitor the application’s progress through the Horizon App.\\n- From {{faq_5b37494f_003}} Dec {{faq_5b37494f_004}} onward, we advise using MyInfo authentication for a faster, more secure submission. Ensure your SingPass details are up‑to‑date before applying.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b4f60c3\", \"content\": \"Question: What verification process does Horizon Bank use to confirm the accuracy of my PayNow name after an update?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we work in conjunction with the PayNow scheme operator to ensure that your PayNow name reflects your registered account name on record. This collaborative effort guarantees that rigorous checks are in place to verify the correctness of your updated PayNow name, providing you with assurance of its accuracy.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_29a71c6f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I take if the data pulled from MyInfo is incorrect?\\n\\nAnswer: - Update your personal details via Singpass.\\n- Wait between {{faq_29a71c6f_001}} and {{faq_29a71c6f_002}} hours for the changes to propagate before re‑submitting your request.\\n- Verify that the address listed in MyInfo is a Singapore address.\\n- Note that for Singapore citizens and permanent residents, address updates may require additional time to appear in MyInfo.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_00cb62c0\", \"content\": \"Question: How will my account name appear to others when I receive payments through Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: As part of our enhanced security measures, effective {{faq_00cb62c0_001}} June {{faq_00cb62c0_002}}, only partial account names will be visible to payers prior to initiating a transfer or payment via the Horizon App or Horizon Bank's online banking platform. For a