n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"resolved_request\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processe