{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T07:18:32.664+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_76e303a9-1ae3-4a25-8d1a-947d608f8c81", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i lost my credit card, what should i do, also i want to change my address too\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: i lost my credit card, what should i do, also i want to change my address too\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address through the mobile app settings or by visiting a branch.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required to verify changes to your registered account profile.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates ensure that all official bank correspondence is sent to your current location.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Credit_Card\", \"Horizon_APP\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address through the mobile app settings or by visiting a branch.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required to verify changes to your registered account profile.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates ensure that all official bank correspondence is sent to your current location.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_11305460\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The only supplied parent concerns credit limit adjustments and contains no information regarding the process for updating a residential address.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_11305460\"], \"reason\": \"The supplied parent faq_11305460 provides a method for updating personal information (contacting Horizon Customer Care), which is relevant to the user's request to change their address. However, it does not explicitly confirm if 'address' is included in the scope of information that can be updated via this channel, nor does it provide the specific procedure for an address change as requested.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_11305460\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Customer Care can be reached via the Horizon app's call or chat function to modify personal details.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my home address when applying for a Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents (effective {{faq_6e2d941d_001}} Oct {{faq_6e2d941d_002}})**: All address modifications must be submitted through Singpass. Steps:\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_003}}. Sign in to Singpass and choose your language.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_004}}. Verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_005}}. Submit the request; ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}‑digit PIN to your new residence.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_007}}. For local addresses, the PIN letter typically arrives within one week.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_008}}. Use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e‑Service portal. (Further guidance available via the provided link.)\\n- **Non‑Singapore residents**:\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_009}}*: Access the myTax Portal with your Singpass or Singpass Foreign Account (SFA), select “Update Contact Details,” and amend your residential or mailing address. The update is reflected within three business days. (More information at the linked page.)\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_010}}*: Go to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website and follow these actions:\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_011}}. Click “Log in for EP Online with Singpass” under the pass‑holder section.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_012}}. Log in using your Singpass credentials.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_013}}. Choose “Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ce650cb6\", \"content\": \"Question: If I change my mobile number, will the previous number linked to PayNow be removed automatically?\\n\\nAnswer: - No, the old mobile number stays active in PayNow until you manually remove it. You can deregister it from the Horizon App using either of the following methods:\\n\\na) Via the Payments area:\\n   • Open the app and go to Money → Payments → Settings (tap the three‑dot icon).\\n   • Select PayNow Registration → Your registered mobile number → Deregister mobile number.\\n\\nb) While updating your contact information:\\n   • Go to Profile → Settings → Personal Details.\\n   • Edit the phone number, submit the change, then choose to deregister the previous number from PayNow.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_817eef20\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to follow to find my Horizon referral code?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, navigate to your profile section, and tap on \\\"Invite Friends\\\" to display your referral code.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_11305460\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I change personal information such as my NRIC/FIN, nationality, name, or the name embossed on my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: - To modify details like NRIC/FIN, nationality, legal name, or the card‑embossing name, reach out to Horizon Customer Care via the Horizon app’s call or chat function. Expect a response within roughly three business days.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_compo