 \"policy\": \"Report lost or stolen cards promptly to prevent unauthorized transactions and limit liability.\", \"conceptual\": \"A lost card report is a security measure to deactivate a compromised credit card account.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6dae126c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for updating the personal identification number associated with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To update your Horizon card PIN, follow these straightforward steps: \\n      * Access your Horizon App account\\n      * Navigate to the 'Card Details' section\\n      * Choose the 'Modify PIN' option and create a new {{faq_6dae126c_001}}-digit PIN for enhanced security and convenience\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ff1c2b9c\", \"content\": \"Question: The Horizon App indicates that my physical card has been delivered, but I have not received it yet.\\n\\nAnswer: - Contact us through the Horizon App by initiating a live chat or a voice call.\\n- Alternatively, you can reach our support line at +{{faq_ff1c2b9c_001}} {{faq_ff1c2b9c_002}}-HORIZ ( +{{faq_ff1c2b9c_003}} {{faq_ff1c2b9c_004}} {{faq_ff1c2b9c_005}} ).\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address through the mobile app settings or by visiting a branch.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required to verify changes to your registered account profile.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates ensure that all official bank correspondence is sent to your current location.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Profile Updates\"], \"customer_component\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address through the mobile app settings or by visiting a branch.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required to verify changes to your registered account profile.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates ensure that all official bank correspondence is sent to your current location.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_47df6d92\", \"content\": \"Question: What happens 